  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "What if a skyscraper could trigger",
      "start": 0.2,
      "end": 1.897
    },
    {
      "text": "an earthquake?",
      "start": 1.897,
      "end": 2.594
    },
    {
      "text": "In Taiwan, scientists noticed something",
      "start": 2.894,
      "end": 4.825
    },
    {
      "text": "strange beneath Taipei one-oh-one.",
      "start": 4.825,
      "end": 7.189
    },
    {
      "text": "As the massive tower rose,",
      "start": 7.229,
      "end": 8.59
    },
    {
      "text": "earthquake activity increased.",
      "start": 8.59,
      "end": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Then, two earthquakes struck beneath",
      "start": 10.2,
      "end": 12.209
    },
    {
      "text": "the area.",
      "start": 12.209,
      "end": 12.702
    },
    {
      "text": "Magnitudes three point eight and three",
      "start": 12.742,
      "end": 14.834
    },
    {
      "text": "point two.",
      "start": 14.834,
      "end": 15.415
    },
    {
      "text": "Researchers found signs of a hidden fault",
      "start": 15.715,
      "end": 17.743
    },
    {
      "text": "deep underground.",
      "start": 17.743,
      "end": 18.644
    },
    {
      "text": "And they suspected the building’s enormous",
      "start": 18.684,
      "end": 20.465
    },
    {
      "text": "weight might have helped trigger",
      "start": 20.465,
      "end": 21.85
    },
    {
      "text": "the shaking.",
      "start": 21.85,
      "end": 22.326
    },
    {
      "text": "But here’s the catch.",
      "start": 22.676,
      "end": 23.756
    },
    {
      "text": "Nobody has proven the tower caused",
      "start": 24.056,
      "end": 25.777
    },
    {
      "text": "those earthquakes.",
      "start": 25.777,
      "end": 26.7
    },
    {
      "text": "So can a skyscraper trigger an earthquake?",
      "start": 27.05,
      "end": 29.061
    },
    {
      "text": "Possibly.",
      "start": 29.361,
      "end": 29.892
    },
    {
      "text": "And that’s what makes this discovery",
      "start": 29.953,
      "end": 31.291
    },
    {
      "text": "so fascinating.",
      "start": 31.291,
      "end": 32.14
    }
  ],
